			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Implement real document loading and message dialog selection\n\nEnhance Window service message dialogs (showInformationMessage, showWarningMessage, showErrorMessage) to properly handle the items parameter by sending gRPC requests with items to Mountain and returning the selected item from the response.\n\nEnhance Workspace service openTextDocument to fetch actual file content from Mountain via fs.readFile instead of returning mock data. Implement full TextDocument interface with proper getText(range), lineAt, offsetAt, positionAt, validateRange, validatePosition methods. Add language detection based on file extension mapping.\n\nAlso add workspace folder DTO conversion to VSCode.WorkspaceFolder objects in AcceptWorkspaceData handler. Remove stale TODO comments about event stream emitters and WorkspaceConfiguration that have been addressed.\n\nThese changes complete the basic document opening flow, enabling real file content to be displayed in the editor with proper language detection.",
